Lab 13: Manage Service Security with Mutual TLS (mTLS)
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the fundamentals of mutual TLS (mTLS) in service mesh architecture
Enable and configure mTLS between services in OpenShift Service Mesh
Implement security policies for service-to-service communication
Test and verify secure communication between microservices
Troubleshoot common mTLS configuration issues
